BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Getting Started in Canada: Money Basics
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260714T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260714T153000
UID:6a2060aaf56bd86e00b442f9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Presented by the\nCanadian Foundation for Financial Planning\n
 \,\nthis workshop helps Canadians\, specifically newcomers\, understand cr
 edit\, debt\, scams to avoid\, and how Canadian financial institutions wor
 k.\nRegistration:\nThis virtual Zoom event is free to join. Once registere
 d\, you’ll receive an email with the Zoom link.\nNeed help with Zoom?\n-
 \nJoining and participating in a Zoom webinar\n-\nZoom Privacy Statement\n
 Information Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is c
 ollected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, se
 ctions 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for ev
 ent and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about ho
 w the library handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff
  at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4
 W 2G8.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a2060aaf56bd86e00b442f9
X-SOURCE:Volunteer Toronto
END:VEVENT
